    "text": "The [I34]dup3[/I34]() function shall be equivalent to the [I35]dup2[/I35]() function, except that it shall be an error if [I36]fildes[/I36]\nis equal to [I37]fildes2[/I37], and the state of FD_CLOEXEC and FD_CLOFORK on the [I38]fildes2[/I38] file descriptor shall be determined\nsolely by the [I39]flag[/I39] argument, which can be constructed from a bitwise-inclusive OR of flags from the following list:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
